Type: Project
Package: iDPSIR
Title: Build and Analyse DPSIR Causal Networks for Environmental Management
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gustavo", "Fonseca", email = "gfonseca@unifesp.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny app to build Driver-Pressure-State-Impact-Response (DPSIR)
    causal networks with standardized path coefficients (beta), and to ask whether
    a planned response covers the worsening caused by a pressure: a static
    sufficiency reading (path-analysis total effect), confidence by resampling
    each strength within its uncertainty band, relevance and priority of the
    Impacts, State triggers, and an optional simulation over discrete time windows
    with self-regulation and growth trends.
